sentences.text:
This appeal under Section 173(1) of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988 (hereinafter referred to as 'the Act',
for short) has been filed by the appellant-claimant being aggrieved by the judgment and award dated 31.07.2019 passed in MVC No.1383/2017 by the Principal Senior Civil Judge and MACT,
Mandya, (hereinafter referred to as 'the Tribunal', for short).

Hence,
the petitioner is entitled for a total compensation of Rs.3,03,172/- under the following heads;
AMOUNT PARTICULARS (IN RS.)

